Bundled assets and their sources:

- apps/models/nsfw_model.tflite — on-device content classifier, bundled from
  the upstream project. No network access at runtime.
- Bible reading passages — King James Version (public domain, English) and
  João Ferreira de Almeida (public domain, Portuguese).
- Quran reading passages — Saheeh International (English) and Samir El-Hayek
  (Portuguese) translations, plus the Arabic Mus'haf text sourced from
  Quran.com (QuranEnc/QUL licensing). See app/src/main/java/com/sarim/app/data/
  ReadingPassages.kt for the per-source attribution.
- Philosophical quotations — public-domain English translations, listed
  individually in ReadingPassages.kt.
